    <string name="settings_speedometer_offset">Speedometer offset</string>
    <string name="settings_speedometer_offset_summary">Orange Box shows your true speed, from the car\'s computer. Car speedometers read a few percent (typically 3–8) high by design. To match yours, show the dashboard speed this much higher. Warnings, trips and stats keep the true speed.</string>
